              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CARYN828"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family raved about this stuffing!! I did add a couple of ingredients just because I had them such as, an orange bell pepper, fresh mushrooms and what I believe really made the difference was I used SMOKED oysters instead of fresh. I'm sure I'll be making this one every year."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AADickson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used 3 cans of clams (instead of 2) and lowered chicken stock to 1/2 can. Skipped the Creole seasoning. Baked in a 13x9 baking dish for 45-50 minutes. It was perfectly moist - not soggy or dry. Everyone at our Thanksgiving table enjoyed this dish - even those that don't like clams. Will make again. Thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2022-11-25T15:56:32.556Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Meg"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm eating it now, delicious! I added fresh mushrooms &amp; sautéed the veggies just a bit before adding. I also put extra broth in. I put it in the oven at 350° for 30 min in 13×9, then 10 min with foil off. If I can do it anyone can, cause I'm not a great cook, lol!",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-24T22:47:47.514Z"
          },
          {
